      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Browser down, API flaking, evidence thin? One retry,\nthen queue it and report the run as degraded. The\npipeline never substitutes a weaker source for a\nmissing one.",
      "originalText": "Browser down, API flaking, evidence thin? One retry, then queue it and report the run as degraded. The pipeline never substitutes a weaker source for a missing one.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
