      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "The daily reconcile runs the same loop backwards: read Apollo, update the store, mirror to the CRM — replies open opportunities, opt-outs are honored\ninstantly.",
      "originalText": "The daily reconcile runs the same loop backwards: read Apollo, update the store, mirror to the CRM — replies open opportunities, opt-outs are honored instantly.",
